{
 "_about": "Daily targeted Google searches (via Serper). 'daily' runs every day for every area; 'pool' is rotated, a fresh slice each day. {area}, {area_bn}, {variant}, {katha} are filled in. tbs: qdr:d day, qdr:w week, qdr:m month, empty = any time.",
